      "markdown": "## Let's Spell\n\n## A Listen, point and repeat\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_378_667_789_1061.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"12%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_953_663_1379_1061.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"12%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1796_659_2252_1074.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"13%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_2360_716_2800_1059.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"13%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_333_1199_826_1609.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"14%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1022_1212_1290_1612.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"8%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1873_1214_2188_1628.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"9%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_2340_1242_2821_1629.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"14%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_361_1780_799_2019.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"13%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_991_1779_1442_2193.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"13%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1699_1736_2214_2190.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"15%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_2371_1775_2788_2186.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"12%\" /></div>\n\n\n## B Listen, colour and repeat\n\n1. $ \\frac{cl}{bl} $ock\n\n3. $ \\frac{cl}{gl} $ass\n\n $$ \\frac{\\mathrm{sl}}{\\mathrm{fl}}\\mathrm{ow} $$ \n\n5. $ \\frac{fl}{sl}y $\n\n6. $ \\textcircled{p} \\frac{pl}{cl} \\textcircled{a} y $\n\n7.  $ \\underline{\\text{sl}} $ ant\n\n8.  $ \\underline{\\text{gl}} $ ide\n\n\n\n## Listen, write and say\n\nMs  $ \\underline{\\text{is slim. She wears}} $  $ \\underline{\\text{.}} $ Her gloves are  $ \\underline{\\text{}} $.\n\n## Listen and repeat\n\nMy little blue plane\n\nIs flying in the sky.\n\nIt flies very slowly,\n\nBut it climbs up high.\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1890_3663_2825_4335.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"28%\" /></div>\n",
